{"id":"reference/Slices","kind":"langref","title":"切片","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Slices","file":"reference/Slices.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Slices","text":"切片"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Slicing-by-Length","text":"按长度切片"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Sentinel-Terminated-Slices","text":"哨兵终止切片"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Slices\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Slices\">切片</a></h2>\n\n      <p>切片由指针和长度组成。数组与切片的区别在于：数组长度属于类型的一部分，在编译时已知；切片长度则在运行时已知。两者都可通过 <code>len</code> 字段访问长度。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_basic_slices.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqualSlices = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqualSlices;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"basic slices\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> known_at_runtime_zero: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    _ = &amp;known_at_runtime_zero;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice = array[known_at_runtime_zero..array.len];\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用结果位置的另一种初始化方式</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> alt_slice: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = &amp;.{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqualSlices(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, slice, alt_slice);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual([]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(slice));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(&amp;array[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>], &amp;slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(array.len, slice.len);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用编译时已知的起止位置切片，结果是</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 指向数组的指针，而不是切片。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> array_ptr = array[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..array.len];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*[array.len]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(array_ptr));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对切片使用取地址运算符，得到单项指针。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(&amp;slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]));\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用 `ptr` 字段，得到多项指针。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual([*]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(slice.ptr));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(slice.ptr), <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(&amp;slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 切片具有数组边界检查。尝试访问越界元素时，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 会触发安全检查失败：</span>\n    slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>] += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 注意，`slice.ptr` 不执行安全检查，而 `&amp;slice[0]`</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 会断言切片满足 len &gt; 0。</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以这样创建空切片：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> empty1 = &amp;[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>{};\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 如果类型已知，可以使用此简写：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> empty2: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = &amp;.{};\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, empty1.len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, empty2.len);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 零长度初始化始终可以用于创建空切片，即使切片可变。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 因为指向的数据长度为零位，其不可变性无关紧要。</span>\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_basic_slices.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_basic_slices.test.basic slices...thread 700490 panic: index out of bounds: index 10, len 4\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_basic_slices.zig:32:10: 0x124e6b8 in test.basic slices (test_basic_slices.zig)\n    slice[10] += 1;\n         ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:295:25: 0x1200951 in mainTerminal (test_runner.zig)\n        if (test_fn.func()) |_| {\n                        ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:74:28: 0x1200132 in main (test_runner.zig)\n        return mainTerminal(init);\n                           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:789:88: 0x11fc8cf in callMain (std.zig)\n    if (fn_info.param_types[0].? == std.process.Init.Minimal) return wrapMain(root.main(.{\n                                                                                       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11fc2b1 in _start (std.zig)\n    asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {\n    ^\nerror: the following test command terminated with signal ABRT:\n/home/andy/src/zig/.zig-cache/o/2aeb962c99d47a840e7d71e9dace847f/test --seed=0xebb328f7\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>这是优先使用切片而非指针的原因之一。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_slices.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqualStrings = std.testing.expectEqualStrings;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> mem = std.mem;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"using slices for strings\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// Zig 没有专门的字符串概念。字符串字面量是常量指针，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 指向以空字节终止的 u8 数组；按照约定，“字符串”参数</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 应当是采用 UTF-8 编码的 u8 切片。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此处将 *const [5:0]u8 和 *const [6:0]u8 强制转换为 []const u8</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> hello: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello\"</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> world: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"世界\"</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> all_together: [<span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对数组使用至少有一个索引在运行时已知的切片语法，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以将数组转换为切片。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> start: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    _ = &amp;start;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> all_together_slice = all_together[start..];\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 字符串拼接示例。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> hello_world = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> mem.print(all_together_slice, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{s} {s}\"</span>, .{ hello, world });\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 通常可以直接使用 UTF-8，无须关心某个值是否为</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 字符串。如果不需要处理单个字符，就不需要</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 解码。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqualStrings(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello 世界\"</span>, hello_world);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"slice pointer\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array: [<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr = &amp;array;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*[<span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(ptr));\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 数组指针可以像数组一样切片：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> start: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> end: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>;\n    _ = .{ &amp;start, &amp;end };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice = ptr[start..end];\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 对可变指针进行切片，得到的切片也可变。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual([]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(slice));\n    slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>] = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, array[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>]);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 同样，使用编译时已知索引切片，会得到另一个</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 指向数组的指针：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ptr2 = slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>..<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, ptr2.len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, ptr2[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(ptr2));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_slices.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_slices.test.using slices for strings...OK\n2/2 test_slices.test.slice pointer...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/for/#for\">for</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n      <h3 id=\"Slicing-by-Length\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Slicing-by-Length\">按长度切片</a></h3>\n\n      <p>虽然 Zig 只提供基于起止索引的切片语法，但可以连续切片两次来表达<strong>按长度切片</strong>的操作。</p>\n      <p>形式 <code>[a .. a + b]</code> 始终更适合写为 <code>[a..][<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..b]</code>，原因如下：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>切片在内存中表示为指针和长度。虽然语法上看似需要两倍操作，但实际机器码反而少一次减法。</li>\n        <li>如果 <code>a</code> 在运行时已知而 <code>b</code> 在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知，前者得到切片，后者则得到指向<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Arrays\">数组</a>的单项<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>。后者通常更安全，因为长度在编译时已知。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">slicing_by_length.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"example\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> runtime_start: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    _ = &amp;runtime_start;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> length = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> array_ptr_len = array[runtime_start..][<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..length];\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(*[length]<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(array_ptr_len));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test slicing_by_length.zig</kbd>\n1/1 slicing_by_length.test.example...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Sentinel-Terminated-Slices\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Slices/#Sentinel-Terminated-Slices\">哨兵终止切片</a></h3>\n\n      <p>语法 <code>[:x]T</code> 表示一种切片，其长度在运行时已知，并保证长度对应的索引位置包含哨兵值。该类型不保证此前没有其他哨兵元素。哨兵终止切片允许访问索引 <code>len</code> 处的元素。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_null_terminated_slice.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"0-terminated slice\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice: [:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello\"</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, slice.len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, slice[<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>]);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_null_terminated_slice.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_null_terminated_slice.test.0-terminated slice...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>也可以使用切片语法的变体 <code>data[start..end :x]</code> 创建哨兵终止切片，其中 <code>data</code> 是多项指针、数组或切片，<code>x</code> 是哨兵值。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_null_terminated_slicing.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"0-terminated slicing\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> runtime_length: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    _ = &amp;runtime_length;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice = array[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..runtime_length :<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>];\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual([:<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(slice));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, slice.len);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_null_terminated_slicing.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_null_terminated_slicing.test.0-terminated slicing...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>哨兵终止切片操作会断言底层数据中哨兵位置的元素确实等于哨兵值。否则会导致需要安全检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_sentinel_mismatch.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"sentinel mismatch\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> array = [_]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>{ <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 从数组创建长度为 2 的哨兵终止切片，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 会使值 `1` 位于哨兵元素位置。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 它与指定的哨兵值 `0` 不匹配，因而会导致</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 运行时恐慌。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> runtime_length: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n    _ = &amp;runtime_length;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> slice = array[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..runtime_length :<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>];\n\n    _ = slice;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_sentinel_mismatch.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_sentinel_mismatch.test.sentinel mismatch...thread 708144 panic: sentinel mismatch: expected 0, found 1\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_sentinel_mismatch.zig:13:24: 0x124c61f in test.sentinel mismatch (test_sentinel_mismatch.zig)\n    const slice = array[0..runtime_length :0];\n                       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:295:25: 0x1200951 in mainTerminal (test_runner.zig)\n        if (test_fn.func()) |_| {\n                        ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:74:28: 0x1200132 in main (test_runner.zig)\n        return mainTerminal(init);\n                           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:789:88: 0x11fc8cf in callMain (std.zig)\n    if (fn_info.param_types[0].? == std.process.Init.Minimal) return wrapMain(root.main(.{\n                                                                                       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11fc2b1 in _start (std.zig)\n    asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {\n    ^\nerror: the following test command terminated with signal ABRT:\n/home/andy/src/zig/.zig-cache/o/014b760bf6b184e3763ae97f78a686b6/test --seed=0xd8ed78c7\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Sentinel-Terminated-Pointers\">哨兵终止指针</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Arrays/#Sentinel-Terminated-Arrays\">哨兵终止数组</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":56,"translated":56}}
